uns 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, across 6 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, the middle saw August to September at 45% of normal and November to December at 42% of normal. Every grid had its driest year in 1953, with grid 21753 at 55% of normal.</p>"}
